            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The functional unit represents a production site for the production of electronic components. Described is AMD’s site in Dresden (Germany), comprising 2 Fabs for the production of Microprocessors. Process data is taken mainly from literature, plus from own estimations. The described plant has an output of 2 Mio pieces per year over a time span of 25 years. In 2023, no major updates are implemented for this dataset, except for the use of updated ICT datasets in the background/inventory, e.g. electronic component machinery, cables, etc.; UUID: 132d38e7-b07e-30a8-8d66-fe05434e2256</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
