        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The AMD site in Saxony is taken as representative of a typical electronic components plant\n\n# Included processes\nThis module includes land use, buildings and facilities (machinery, cables, etc.) as well as the respective disposal activities of a microprocessor production site, used as example for a electronic component plant.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
